00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:29.509
so when I do, I've got
Christmas music goin',

00:11:29.509 --> 00:11:31.740
wrappin' in my dinin'
room like a crazy person.

00:11:31.740 --> 00:11:33.090
- And I love your Christmas music.

00:11:33.090 --> 00:11:34.789
- Oh, thank you, oh thank you.

00:11:34.789 --> 00:11:38.180
I love Christmas music,
oh my god, I'm with you.

00:11:38.180 --> 00:11:40.780
So what's Christmas like
at the McGraw house?

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:42.250
- Should we confess?

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.230
- Yes.
- Yes.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:46.649
- When it comes that time a year,

00:11:46.649 --> 00:11:48.130
- If you say you don't like Christmas,

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:48.963
I'm gonna smack you.

00:11:48.963 --> 00:11:49.796
- No, listen.

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:53.030
Tell me if I'm lyin',

00:11:53.030 --> 00:11:58.010
we record every Hallmark
Christmas movie every year,

00:11:58.010 --> 00:12:00.341
and watch every one of 'em.

00:12:00.341 --> 00:12:01.861
I'm serious.

00:12:01.861 --> 00:12:03.882
We've watched every
movie you've ever made.

00:12:03.882 --> 00:12:04.772
- Are you serious?

00:12:04.772 --> 00:12:05.605
- No, I'm serious.

00:12:05.605 --> 00:12:06.438
- I'm so flattered.

00:12:06.438 --> 00:12:07.271
- More than once.

00:12:07.271 --> 00:12:08.830
- I think we've still got
like 30 of 'em recorded

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.112
on our DVR.
- It's a tradition.

00:12:11.112 --> 00:12:12.242
- We like binge watch 'em,

00:12:12.242 --> 00:12:14.042
we've seen every one of your movies.

00:12:15.071 --> 00:12:17.326
- I'm so flattered, thank
you, that's so nice.

00:12:17.326 --> 00:12:18.159
- We love 'em.

